OL,3,GNEWSACycle lanes reviewed after
OL,4,Athousands sign petition
OL,5,
OL,6,FCycle lane schemes in Rotherham will be
OL,7,Freviewed and greater consideration
OL,8,Fgiven to road safety measures after
OL,9,Fthousands of people signed a petition.
OL,11,FThe 3,600-signature petition, which
OL,12,Fcouncillors unanimously accepted,
OL,13,Fcalled for all existing and proposed
OL,14,Fschemes funded through the City Region
OL,15,FSustainable Transport Settlement to be
OL,16,Freconsidered.
OL,18,FThe petition called for crossings,
OL,19,Ftraffic calming, wider pavements and
OL,20,Fsafer routes to schools to be
OL,21,Fprioritised over dedicated cycle and
OL,22,Fbus lanes.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
