OL,3,GNEWSACycle lanes reviewed after
OL,4,Athousands sign petition
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a meeting on Wednesday, Conservative
OL,7,Fcouncillor Paul Thorp said: "All the
OL,8,Fcurrent build schemes have proven the
OL,9,Fpoint: the lanes are not used and the
OL,10,Fdata has not been positive for any of
OL,11,Fthem."
